{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_020a496a591bcacc57dc87e0a3dcf7401640c6e3e1128853ba970b17fb82ebe7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"get-vix/vix@8e4262d6d1a8 snapshot 5bb529b55446d470","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_40712dfc30962b4b5671088170bfa4c74725d3921524d6b559d85e7c59371c9e","slc_98b9865b222a1c07d691474c18d590fe40beacfe87e4c5a6da56ea3bef1a87fe","slc_ad6f701d30807f0b4f56b3a1466dad53dd3af73f1ac20a5b916019eba11801a2"],"source_ids":["src_03f2deb9c7e851499ba61146fe05d758","src_4529e061c00b5176944c21cbceb4a9b3"],"text":"Vix ships built-in provider support for Anthropic, OpenAI, OpenRouter, OrcaRouter, AWS Bedrock, Ollama, llama.cpp, and Lemonade, among others.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_11d79d5e65c091396041c791d76df936842330d482f6b1e55b4d294a3a17f1e6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"get-vix/vix@8e4262d6d1a8 snapshot 5bb529b55446d470","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3fa02a4cd15a614c499e929b0ea830169b7f8086ab2251b069e628908ba4142f","slc_5def166cd2eeaceac409687e40c822e4e8dc60951cf547eaa7b02bb3bd5ea85f","slc_e2c289b1815812f1781ddc9093938c06d8ef778ed9212b47cdb404dcb195de27"],"source_ids":["src_03f2deb9c7e851499ba61146fe05d758"],"text":"With local:true, the model list is fetched live from an OpenAI-compatible GET /models endpoint (cached 5 seconds), with Ollama- and llama.cpp-specific probes for loaded models and context lengths; unreachable servers show as offline after a 1.5s timeout.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_16ad7ac3f1bb1bc1b0eee0e21bd983a2faa14e55e5129d60c20e2fb8c8e0e9ab","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"get-vix/vix@8e4262d6d1a8 snapshot 5bb529b55446d470","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5b96ec86f15bb86bd12e43724f1e97e01b232036e6bc3d9534151dba66ade1a1","slc_d1a8ebf172eb8a16a432a321d199cfb1b6e4a4a58ef4f715417d59d7176d10ac"],"source_ids":["src_4529e061c00b5176944c21cbceb4a9b3"],"text":"Rather than limiting exploration, vix strips whitespace characters from file content via a virtual filesystem so the LLM works on minified code, reportedly reducing tokens by 20-50%.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3545dc45d9b7ad479e2c620228964c63671d24e94377e6814db097a6c512f092","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"get-vix/vix@8e4262d6d1a8 snapshot 5bb529b55446d470","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_57eaf45a6f5076d9fd989d8c662b8beb7bebedc9b0e2c61e21851d6fb9aed663","slc_979fd2954d05c6565a99fb006bfa0de260427ee58032c0c0e817733f3ce15b72","slc_a736f001ff160e5b129c90233d86a259aeee646ecb60ed9963367df6bbe218e2","slc_b3c6a9a49f610161dda2fab292cbf65e2ee72a04bb6bccd986902e6863b51201"],"source_ids":["src_4529e061c00b5176944c21cbceb4a9b3"],"text":"The product consists of a daemon (vixd) and a client (vix); the daemon is started first, and multiple isolated vix instances can then be run.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6aa395684bce4bc756bb56e6d7a535a88804a7a56c6b15f67ba6af213c1fdaae","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"get-vix/vix@8e4262d6d1a8 snapshot 5bb529b55446d470","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1e7948566814fcd158f8288971b1d6618a5a5fc92b462a9681e8e4aaf2c37e55","slc_3a4d934459d5279a7957e869fe5b77a1264073eef5e2e8054fdd5e266576a13f"],"source_ids":["src_4529e061c00b5176944c21cbceb4a9b3"],"text":"Vix is described as a fast, token-efficient AI coding agent whose stem agents maximize prompt-cache reuse across phases and whose Tree-sitter virtual filesystem lets it read and edit minified code, claimed to cut tokens 20-50%.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_77520a9f5f9f5181495cb44caca0365d9a205b40aa0f34d2ddbdac3e0bda989a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"get-vix/vix@8e4262d6d1a8 snapshot 5bb529b55446d470","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6716bfd1075f044d2cf56eb45d5b190263711efaf3d018fd9f82e4eb05256715","slc_eab1d1d0fa5698353438e889946c31201cc72ce3b1d8348308cb1d05467b18ed"],"source_ids":["src_4529e061c00b5176944c21cbceb4a9b3"],"text":"Users can define multi-phase agent pipelines in JSON with agent, bash, and tool steps, including templating, branching, parallelism, and history forking; custom workflows are configured in settings.json.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8624316264fceb42feac30c1bf13c2dbf6cf44166f2e8aa07bb2dbb17b6f4ded","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"get-vix/vix@8e4262d6d1a8 snapshot 5bb529b55446d470","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2fa378b666f597a0578be117303e8dcd8b6f697879a6cc93dd63bc27e98196a5","slc_894103f4738385c63762cef901bf1a24931bdf4ae6e82a7b690cab8e27db17c2"],"source_ids":["src_03f2deb9c7e851499ba61146fe05d758"],"text":"The wire_format field selects among a closed set of compiled HTTP adapters: chat_completions (OpenAI-compatible), messages (Anthropic), and responses (OpenAI Responses API); other values are rejected at load.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9eb24386eb08953c860267c104b348ed50e7cdcc328b18c4d47e2c62583b44f9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"get-vix/vix@8e4262d6d1a8 snapshot 5bb529b55446d470","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_51b3c57c511595b09a5912be3fb02a0607baffd1baf45a58861f73280313add7","slc_71d28bca2d569f8ba8421a9bbb509c9307b4c319b598a5fa4f10d18516bbe48a","slc_a418d27666836a4db1aaf547328857ac55332a6ab9cdbfff03b3a109538632e3"],"source_ids":["src_4529e061c00b5176944c21cbceb4a9b3"],"text":"The stem-agent design uses a generic system prompt with per-phase instructions delivered as user messages, so the explore-phase history stays cached when the LLM is told to act as a planner.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a5cf3e5c13cf84d1175817479e9b17a39f8dd35f9f3e5c88d179a86fe9697aa8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"get-vix/vix@8e4262d6d1a8 snapshot 5bb529b55446d470","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c69e5b84db24e1eca8e2b22d42e23a4aa2f7285c0e50f7d1656666903185a41b"],"source_ids":["src_4529e061c00b5176944c21cbceb4a9b3"],"text":"Vix advertises standard agent capabilities including skills, MCP servers, subagents, LSP-backed code intelligence, sandboxed execution, and multiple providers.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_abb732c45493367b0f6915840bdd8cca6f6627623c11943bb9e173bbb96afbb1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"get-vix/vix@8e4262d6d1a8 snapshot 5bb529b55446d470","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0ea0060ffc2a024abd7c1c99113f00ccac635cd51b771514cc8f5fad94d8909e","slc_0f5ff689fba6ff12ecd9e1a6b697f4d2cfe6bf1317a39fbae53825b2109c2eaf","slc_120d48508b4a81c9c0b33526e730d5fd332f59a00427ca6d589dd861a629b8f3","slc_5c7cdc54e9e3a6de09e8e258e4a1af05478677f513ca1268424d7acff4c52af2","slc_b4dccc47f7681b0a5f4093386f8f8e3b471b1d7517e68f518d5e53039f160b3b"],"source_ids":["src_7c431ca199085353904ede9229ad82d8"],"text":"Both vixd and vix expose a pprof HTTP server via --pprof-port (default ports 6060 and 6061, overridable by VIX_PPROF_PORT), serving goroutine, heap, allocs, and CPU profiles.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b8e46ecd9b155effeb248f4b2382de30c9607eab80d846fc35e3c0cdf2efbb9c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"get-vix/vix@8e4262d6d1a8 snapshot 5bb529b55446d470","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_65f86abcca41a018333bb2ce5cc3e43c9e7d3917e537f0d966ca61e908b6c98e","slc_985431f7447a9337f479c6aab621c8935ca0bdd59bebdefe16fa58b6222608f0","slc_9e8b08d2f095fd852adc1a2768e53930c1bb7ef51dcbe0328803f0a3be5c031c","slc_b6e06ae0034bfc9a36a08b546b3aa210220f726e3fd0fe39a04c0793fb6de946","slc_d8b0e4ca8f5a50a0d94debd45a71e960f51141c409e5c004dbad4f8decbdde2c"],"source_ids":["src_03f2deb9c7e851499ba61146fe05d758"],"text":"Credential methods are tried in order and the first to resolve wins; kinds include api_key (env var or keyring), none, and OAuth flows (oauth_token, oauth_mint_key) referencing auth_logins entries by login_id.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_beb97569d494bc062e86ddd6ffe7a1bd7b1d273af53365716936762caac39830","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"get-vix/vix@8e4262d6d1a8 snapshot 5bb529b55446d470","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_04de5e19310aba99a218cf1074cb83d216eebb54a2ace6441d417f73119b51d5","slc_80cbb496807b3f49767341dfb94284fd1d56cee607dcd65b052a0a85cdfc80e7","slc_e72602b07ef863eed2409c3e8da2aee67e49da1707bb36d5996e6e38e37f327e"],"source_ids":["src_4529e061c00b5176944c21cbceb4a9b3"],"text":"Installation is via a curl-piped install script or Homebrew tap (get-vix/vix), and requires ANTHROPIC_API_KEY to be set in the environment.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c173eb70a76e93de12a84d0fb32d7f022d42b77c8f5facbfe3596e47887ddd20","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"get-vix/vix@8e4262d6d1a8 snapshot 5bb529b55446d470","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1e6d9e3dde30fefb4f9d5be029e197f0a73bdcda6d2bb0f5b722c3fa1f5f58e6","slc_64fa8965641330a70704df443f9a1eb8aeb4a22b79f47089bc14ff6340535607","slc_b14943b4fe47371efc7c9ca7f50e600cf1538d6810f9f54ee3cc9e92f8f3f13a","slc_cf26cf341374a06cecc4120804b10ae9a3a6a974afe5daa7c1f1811b15ce3c49","slc_f6ae28ff90dffe8ca15c5f8056ceec685b3d7b75b03aabdb5cd6823c436f3cd0"],"source_ids":["src_4529e061c00b5176944c21cbceb4a9b3"],"text":"The README reports a self-described non-scientific benchmark of vix plan mode against Claude Code on 7 real coding scenarios with the same prompt, measuring time and cost, with reproducible transcripts in a separate vix-eval repo; vix was faster and cheaper on almost all tasks.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_daf1e6e7c86ca43435b0d4dea6aeef9eb60326b604f33b1f7698510de294f8e4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"get-vix/vix@8e4262d6d1a8 snapshot 5bb529b55446d470","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b14943b4fe47371efc7c9ca7f50e600cf1538d6810f9f54ee3cc9e92f8f3f13a"],"source_ids":["src_4529e061c00b5176944c21cbceb4a9b3"],"text":"The benchmark summary notes vix lost on one task involving a 3,000+ line file, because minification only helped during exploration while execution fell back to regular read/edit tools.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ebaacd428ce48ed5c86ba840771f868324e5ee616cb4c0486337f474da618095","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"get-vix/vix@8e4262d6d1a8 snapshot 5bb529b55446d470","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2bf47ee263eb459b61450bbffac644b3e616f52ea3c2a89dc299a6923dc4466d"],"source_ids":["src_4529e061c00b5176944c21cbceb4a9b3"],"text":"The README warns that vix currently works only on macOS and Linux.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ebfe153201e4121ed4c396c411725a8a6b69e32bf6b230a052ec0bb5ce5c779b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"get-vix/vix@8e4262d6d1a8 snapshot 5bb529b55446d470","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_71800a9bb8f22628cc55b86350146c2752d30f88711bb15eae2fe4593a1f6f32","slc_9b6de826d230331c3076854ccb4cad769702ea8f6c119ead528b9a94d0ad290d","slc_ce20486c413b478abd465282526f01bf849336ea40680bb879d64f193de23560","slc_de234be0af27b10895e5d7c804be930bef54596e7609ec33fb2b12c811ec4791"],"source_ids":["src_03f2deb9c7e851499ba61146fe05d758","src_4529e061c00b5176944c21cbceb4a9b3"],"text":"Providers are configured via a providers.json overlay in ~/.vix/ or ./.vix/ merged over an embedded base: same-id entries are field-patched, new ids appended, and models/credential_methods arrays replace wholesale.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a352d9dd03f14970b71d8b60d63f00d1"}
